  "description": "One day, Yoon Sol learns about lucid dreaming.\nAfter that, his longtime crush Kang Wooju begins appearing in his dreams, and Sol uses his newfound control to kiss him. Each time Sol dreams, he goes on dates with Wooju and indulges in intimate moments, blurring the line between fantasy and desire. As the dreams repeat, Sol’s longing to stay asleep grows stronger, until he becomes completely addicted to his lucid world.\n\n*“In my dreams, I’ll do whatever I want.”*\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://bomtoon.com/detail/Lucidream)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.lezhin.jp/comic/lucid), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/lucid_dream)",
